  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53c2ea0a75acc54a18088-65008df7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion.\n• Rinse red lentils.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53c2ea0a75acc54a18088-be897cdb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend, tomato paste, ginger paste and half the garlic. Cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water, coconut milk and the salt. Stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53c2ea0a75acc54a18088-195a5feb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add lentils to the saucepan. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium-low. Cover with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until lentils are softened and dhal is thickened, 20-22 minutes.\n• Once cooked, stir through roasted veggies and season to taste with salt and pepper. TIP: If the dhal is looking a little dry at any point, just add a splash of water!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53c2ea0a75acc54a18088-e7efa405.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the dhal has 10 minutes remaining, combine a drizzle of olive oil, remaining garlic and a pinch of salt and pepper in a small bowl.\n• Slice mini flourtortillas (see ingredients) into strips.\n• Place tortilla strips in a single layer on a second lined oven tray, then drizzle or brush with the garlic oil. Bake until golden, 8-10 minutes. TIP: Use two oven trays if your tortilla don't fit in a single layer.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53c2ea0a75acc54a18088-de95f521.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop roasted almonds.\n• Divide Indian potato and cauliflower dhal between bowls.\n• Garnish with almonds and chilli flakes (if using).\n• Tear over coriander and serve with garlic tortilla dippers. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66c53c2ea0a75acc54a18088-b60d76b1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
